      "first_line_excerpt": "A representation can carry information about a label and still fail to cluster by it."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0015",
      "sha256": "3b7d2eb97754255f6aafe824000d11fd462a60f3f4a5e957339c7c2e8e38b5fc",
      "char_start": 4700,
      "char_end": 5440,
      "n_chars": 740,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "The most directly related work, by Filice et al.~\\cite{lookingbeyond2026}, benchmarks ECG foundation models ag"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0016",
      "sha256": "14b62aaec3ae83a3d49463cd5b05331ee802d384f3014cefb6f5c77104e2f8ba",
      "char_start": 5442,
      "char_end": 7116,
      "n_chars": 1674,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "first_line_excerpt": "We therefore compare five representations for the unsupervised separation of sinus rhythm (SR) from atrial fib"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0017",
      "sha256": "4afdec2dfaa41e91e84c8aeb37b136759effc3da5decf940f5cf2292f405ecda",
