      "char_start": 10982,
      "char_end": 11685,
      "n_chars": 703,
      "section": "Data and cohorts",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\paragraph{PTB-XL.} We use PTB-XL \\cite{ptbxl2020}, a public 12-lead database (21\\,799 records, 18\\,869 patien"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0025",
