      "n_chars": 44,
      "section": "Data and cohorts",
      "first_line_excerpt": "\\subsection{Representations}\\label{sec:repr}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0028",
      "sha256": "2683488abf8b6c122800cd0389e2189936aa60d61fc491ee081cb176d701fd15",
      "char_start": 13613,
      "char_end": 16658,
      "n_chars": 3045,
      "section": "Representations",
      "first_line_excerpt": "We compare five representations on PTB-XL. Table~\\ref{tab:repr} gives the input, dimension and pretraining of "
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0029",
      "sha256": "b918eb348f38217d49967b3ae3546045d48eade7df189d6ef2d8c0de846d088a",
      "char_start": 16660,
      "char_end": 17722,
      "n_chars": 1062,
      "section": "Representations",
      "first_line_excerpt": "Only the hand-crafted features use a single lead. Raw flattening reproduces the 12-lead representation of the "
    },
    {
      "block_id": "B0030",
      "sha256": "562ded912a4f15995848c230ea8527ee35f8770891a0d8cd2befaf7cc4d9a3d8",
      "char_start": 17724,
      "char_end": 18276,
      "n_chars": 552,
      "section": "Representations",
      "first_line_excerpt": "We chose the two foundation models by three criteria. Both have public weights and take 12-lead input. They di"
    },
